# ==========================================================================
# ARES — repository ignore rules
#
# Repo root is ares/. The reference capture, the SAM 3 weights, the archive
# capture tree and the research PDFs all live in the PARENT folder, outside
# this repo entirely — they need no rules here and cannot be added by
# accident.
# ==========================================================================

# --- Dependencies & build output ------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Large optional install: the SAM service venv (~4.8 GB of torch/CUDA).
# Rebuilt from tools/sam-service/requirements.txt; the in-app Settings tab
# documents the sources and installs it in one click.
tools/sam-service/env/

# --- Secrets --------------------------------------------------------------
# SSH keypairs used to drive RunPod GPU pods. NEVER commit.
# NOTE: .runpod/account-pubkey-backup.txt is misleadingly named — it is an
# unencrypted PRIVATE key (armor-stripped openssh-key-v1), not a public key.
.runpod/
*.pem
*.ppk
id_rsa
id_ed25519
.env
.env.*

# --- Third-party / proprietary binaries -----------------------------------
# 4DViews native codec, licensed to the owner via his own SDK agreement.
tools/4ds/bin/
# Vendored realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan (BSD-3) — 50 MB of upstream weights + exe.
tools/bin/

# --- Generated data: clips & their sidecars -------------------------------
# .ares clips are encoder output (~3 GB across 34 files here) and several are
# captures of third parties. apps/demo/demo.ares regenerates via:
#   node packages/encoder/dist/cli.js synth -o apps/demo/demo.ares
*.ares
# Bound-by-blood metadata sidecars — embed absolute source paths.
*.ares.meta.json
# Edit sidecars and the app's rolling backups of them. The .bak suffix means
# *.edits.json alone does NOT match them — hence the explicit rule.
*.edits.json
*.edits.json.bak
*.bak
*.orig

# Per-user app state written server-side by the demo app.
apps/demo/history.json
apps/demo/showcase.json
apps/demo/.thumbs/

# --- Generated data: bake pipeline ----------------------------------------
# Coherent-GOP intermediates, ~4.3 GB. All regenerate from the source capture
# via tools/coherent/run-coherent-bake.mjs.
.coherent-bake-work/
.coherent-bake-work-v4/
.coherent-preview-src/
.coherent-ckpt-*/
# Bake manifest: regenerated, and records absolute local paths.
coherent-manifest.json

# SAM-3D inference output (~88 MB); re-runs from the sam3d tools.
sam3d-results/

# Benchmark output — bench/src/run.ts writes these. The harness, its README
# and the hand-written bench/report/index.html ARE tracked.
bench/results/
bench/data/

# --- Logs & scratch -------------------------------------------------------
*.log
tools/sam-service/uvicorn-out.txt
tools/sam-service/uvicorn-err.txt
scratchpad/
scratch-*.mjs

# --- Internal working notes (not for the repo) ----------------------------
# Session handoffs, agent-to-agent logs, dated status reports, decision logs.
# Kept on disk locally; deliberately excluded from version control.
HANDOFF.md
BACKLOG.md
DECISIONS.md
REPORT-webgl2-worker.md
docs/reports/
docs/audit-*.md
docs/recon-audit.md
docs/sam-enhance-integration.md
docs/remeshing-decision.md
docs/ui-design-notes.md
docs/ai_text_tropes_guide.md
# Machine-specific inventory: hostname, GPU, local install paths.
docs/local-ai-inventory.md

# Tool READMEs kept local pending a rewrite for public consumption.
tools/4ds/README.md
tools/svf-extract/README-runbook.md

# Superseded screenshot, referenced by nothing.
docs/images/convert-tab.png

# --- Editor / OS / agent scratch ------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
.claude/
.playwright-mcp/
